So many of them follow the same schema: short, about 10-minute-long, videos that explain some parts of life in an easy way. 
And most of these channels are also suspiciously young at the time of writing. All created in 2025. 
The scary thing is, they are getting too close to emulating genuine, informative channels, ran by real people.